---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
// PLACEHOLDER: review this notice before launch, and update it if you add analytics or other tools.
const updated = '29 October 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Outside In collects, uses and stores personal information sent through this website.">
  <article class="band privacy">
   <div class="wrap privacy__in">
    <p class="label">[ Privacy notice ]</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="privacy__date">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use the contact form we collect your name, email address, business (if you give it), the services you tick and your message. If you book a call, the booking service collects the details it asks for.</p>
    <p>When you request a Findable free check we collect your business name, website, region, category, email address and, if you give it, a question visitors might ask. When you use the Findable contact form we collect your name, email address, what kind of organisation you are and your message.</p>

    <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
    <p>Only to reply to your enquiry and, if you choose to work with us, to manage that work. Free check requests are used only to run your check and send you the results. We don’t sell your information or add you to a mailing list without asking.</p>

    <h2>Where it’s stored</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are processed and stored by our website’s form provider and delivered to our email. Booking details are held by our scheduling provider. These services may store data outside New Zealand.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiries and free check requests only as long as we need them to follow up. Ask us at any time and we’ll delete yours.</p>

    <h2>Findable</h2>
    <p>The Findable application is a separate service with its own sign-in. This notice covers this website, including the Findable free check and contact forms.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>This website doesn’t use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020 you can ask to see the personal information we hold about you and ask us to correct it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we’ll respond as soon as we can.</p>
   </div>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy__in { max-width: 760px; }
  .privacy h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.95; margin-block: 16px 8px; }
  .privacy h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .privacy p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .privacy p + p { margin-top: 1em; }
  .privacy__date { color: var(--brown-soft); }
  .privacy a { color: var(--maroon); }
</style>
